# Version control & editor artifacts
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Python caches & virtualenvs
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/venv

# Nested Node modules & Next.js build outputs (rebuilt cleanly inside containers)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.remotion
services/video-renderer/public/audio_temp
services/video-renderer/public/assets
services/video-renderer/public/music

# Temporary media, caches & local test reports
**/.temp
**/out
**/exports
**/tmp
**/temp
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/*.mp4
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
**/*.srt

# Environment secrets (passed at runtime by docker-compose)
.env
.env.*
services/api-gateway/.env
apps/web/.env.local
!.env.example
!services/api-gateway/.env.example
!apps/web/.env.example
